<p>Learn the basics of leather work and create your own notebook slipcover under the guidance of a skilled artisan from Cumberland Heritage Village Museum. In this beginner-friendly workshop, you will learn to layout, emboss, stitch a heritage style slipcover that will fit a 4 x 6 notebook. Supplies are included in the cost of registration. Light refreshments will be served.</p>
